{"unit_id":"zizhongfeiyang__dsh-settings-drawer#card-zh","repo":"zizhongfeiyang/dsh-settings-drawer","commit":"fda3b0fd9abb66ab9bc3e9296fa8aff1c42f0d2c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Settings Drawer 是一个面向 DSH Web 设置页的插件，在左侧导航加入设置抽屉，并过滤设置栏目、插件标签和插件配置项的显示。用户可以查看当前注册的项目、逐项隐藏或恢复，改动会立即生效并保存在浏览器中；核心栏目默认保留，也可一键只显示核心项目或恢复默认。它适合希望精简设置导航、整理插件入口的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key 或外部服务，显示偏好存于浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:9-16","lib/client.js:183-248"]}
{"unit_id":"zizhongfeiyang__dsh-settings-drawer#card-en","repo":"zizhongfeiyang/dsh-settings-drawer","commit":"fda3b0fd9abb66ab9bc3e9296fa8aff1c42f0d2c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Settings Drawer adds a DSH web drawer to hide or restore settings sections, plugin tabs, and configuration entries. Changes apply immediately and are saved in browser storage. Core entries can stay visible, and defaults can be restored. It simplifies settings without API keys or external services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:9-16","lib/client.js:183-248"]}
